---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ArrowRight, BookOpenText, CalendarDays, Clock3, Newspaper, Sparkles } from '@lucide/astro';
import { getBlogPosts } from '../lib/blog';

const posts = await getBlogPosts();
const featuredPost = posts[0];
---

<Layout
  title="블로그 - AgentHub"
  description="AgentHub 블로그에서 AI 에이전트 도구, MCP 서버, 에이전트 스킬, GitOps 레지스트리 운영 노트를 확인하세요."
>
  <div class="container blog-container">
    <section class="blog-hero">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <Newspaper size={14} class="rose-icon" />
        <span>AgentHub Blog</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="blog-title">
        에이전트 도구를 더 잘 고르고<br />
        <span class="text-gradient">더 오래 운영하는 방법</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="blog-subtitle">
        MCP 서버, 에이전트 스킬, 플러그인, 브라우저 확장을 실제 워크플로에 붙일 때 필요한 운영 노트를 모았습니다.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="featured-section glass-panel" aria-labelledby="featured-heading">
      <a href={`/blog/${featuredPost.slug}`} class="featured-copy featured-copy-link" aria-label={`${featuredPost.title} 상세 보기`}>
        <div class="section-kicker">
          <Sparkles size={15} />
          <span>추천 글</span>
        </div>
        <h2 id="featured-heading">{featuredPost.title}</h2>
        <p>{featuredPost.description}</p>
        <div class="featured-footer">
          <div class="post-meta">
            <span>
              <CalendarDays size={15} />
              {featuredPost.date}
            </span>
            <span>
              <Clock3 size={15} />
              {featuredPost.readTime}
            </span>
          </div>
          <span class="featured-read-more">
            읽기
            <ArrowRight size={16} />
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="featured-panel">
        <BookOpenText size={34} />
        <span>{featuredPost.category}</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="post-section" aria-labelledby="latest-heading">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 id="latest-heading" class="section-title">최신 글</h2>
        <span class="results-count">{posts.length}개</span>
      </div>

      <div class="post-grid">
        {posts.map((post) => (
          <a href={`/blog/${post.slug}`} class="post-card-link" aria-label={`${post.title} 상세 보기`}>
            <article class="post-card glass-card">
              <div class="post-card-top">
                <span class="post-category">{post.category}</span>
                <span class="post-read-time">
                  <Clock3 size={14} />
                  {post.readTime}
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3>{post.title}</h3>
              <p>{post.description}</p>
              <div class="tag-list" aria-label={`${post.title} 태그`}>
                {post.tags.map((tag) => (
                  <span class="tag-pill">#{tag}</span>
                ))}
              </div>
              <div class="post-footer">
                <span>
                  <CalendarDays size={14} />
                  {post.date}
                </span>
                <span class="read-more">
                  읽기
                  <ArrowRight size={15} />
                </span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="editor-note glass-panel">
      <Newspaper size={18} />
      <p>
        블로그 글은 <code>src/content/blog</code> 콘텐츠 컬렉션으로 관리됩니다. frontmatter를 갖춘 Markdown 파일 하나를 추가해 Pull Request를 올리면 새 글이 발행됩니다.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .blog-container {
    padding-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .blog-hero {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto 44px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.25);
    color: rgb(var(--accent-rose));
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .rose-icon {
    color: hsl(var(--rose-point));
  }

  .blog-title {
    font-size: 3.25rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    line-height: 1.14;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .blog-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    color: hsl(var(--text-secondary));
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .featured-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 260px;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .section-kicker {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    color: rgb(var(--accent-cyan-link));
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .featured-copy-link {
    display: block;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 4px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .featured-copy-link *,
  .post-card-link * {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .featured-copy-link:hover h2,
  .post-card-link:hover h3 {
    color: rgb(var(--accent-cyan-link));
  }

  .featured-copy-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid rgb(var(--accent-cyan) / 0.75);
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }

  .featured-copy h2 {
    color: hsl(var(--text-primary));
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.22;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .featured-copy p {
    color: hsl(var(--text-secondary));
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .featured-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .post-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    color: hsl(var(--text-muted));
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .featured-read-more {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    color: rgb(var(--accent-cyan-link));
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .featured-copy-link:hover .featured-read-more,
  .post-card-link:hover .read-more {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .post-meta span,
  .post-read-time,
  .post-footer span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .featured-panel {
    min-height: 190px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--accent-cyan) / 0.22);
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(var(--accent-cyan) / 0.12), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08)),
      var(--surface-subtle);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 22px;
    color: rgb(var(--accent-cyan-link));
  }

  .featured-panel span {
    color: hsl(var(--text-primary));
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .results-count {
    color: hsl(var(--text-muted));
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .post-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .post-card-link {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .post-card-link,
  .post-card-link:visited,
  .featured-copy-link,
  .featured-copy-link:visited {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .post-card-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid rgb(var(--accent-cyan) / 0.75);
    outline-offset: 4px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  .post-card {
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 320px;
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .post-card-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .post-category {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 28px;
    padding: 5px 11px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--accent-cyan) / 0.3);
    background: rgb(var(--accent-cyan) / 0.1);
    color: rgb(var(--accent-cyan-link));
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .post-read-time {
    color: hsl(var(--text-muted));
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .post-card h3 {
    color: hsl(var(--text-primary));
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    line-height: 1.32;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .post-card p {
    color: hsl(var(--text-secondary));
    line-height: 1.58;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .tag-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .tag-pill {
    color: hsl(var(--text-muted));
    background: var(--surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .post-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 22px;
    color: hsl(var(--text-muted));
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .read-more {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    color: rgb(var(--accent-cyan-link));
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .editor-note {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    color: hsl(var(--text-secondary));
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  code {
    background: var(--surface-subtle);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 2px 5px;
    color: hsl(var(--text-primary));
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .featured-section,
    .post-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .blog-container {
      padding-top: 28px;
    }

    .blog-title {
      font-size: 2.05rem;
      overflow-wrap: keep-all;
    }

    .blog-subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .featured-section,
    .post-card {
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .featured-footer {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .featured-copy h2 {
      font-size: 1.55rem;
    }

    .featured-panel {
      min-height: 150px;
    }
  }
</style>
